  "headline": "Enalapril maleate is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 44.4 days on hand and Corvale General has 18.8 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include enalapril maleate as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 507 tablets of the 10 mg presentation at a daily use of 11.4 tablets, providing 44.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 262 tablets of the 10 mg presentation at a daily use of 14 tablets, providing 18.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked alternate manufacturer is Amici Pharma, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A label for Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407) shows a registered plant with a most recent VAI inspection ending 2026-07-16.",
      "cites": ["E14", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earlier FDA records for that plant include an OAI inspection in 2009 and a Warning Letter in 2010, but no recent OAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Buyer should verify current supply commitments with Amici Pharma, Inc. and monitor the Bryant Ranch Prepack plant inspection history for any change in classification.",
      "cites": ["D4", "E14", "E12"]
    }
  ]
}
